    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάρανδος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ὁ</span>, a horned beast, native of
		Scythia, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reindeer</i>, or
			more prob. <i>elk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				832b8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				371
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				172.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάρανδρος</span></b>  is
			better attested in <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.384
			</span></i>, and is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
			</span></i>l.c.; so <i>tarandrus</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				8.123
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				124
			</span></i> (<i>parandrum</i> in Solin. <i><span class="en">
				25.30
			</span></i>).</div>
